-over-4x-in-dec-quarter/articleshow/97752411.cms?from=mdr','PRESS RELEASE',7996,'press',0,1,'2025-12-19 12:37:50','2025-12-24 09:54:54','2023-12-20 00:00:00'),(26,'press','Press Release Ruby Medical Services unveils India’s first Anamaya MRI machine by 3i MedTech, a landmark ‘Make in India’ initiative',NULL,NULL,'/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-cropped-punekarnews-1766571435481-208596.png',4,'https://www.punekarnews.in/pune-ruby-medical-services-unveils-indias-first-anamaya-mri-machine-by-3i-medtech-a-landmark-make-in-india-initiative/','PRESS RELEASE',7986,'press',0,1,'2025-12-19 12:50:30','2025-12-24 10:17:19','2025-12-19 00:00:00'),(27,'press','Women’s Ulitmate Frisbee Tournament To Be Sponsored By Refex Group',NULL,NULL,'/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-apn-logo-1766571891609-864280.png',13,'https://www.apnnews.com/womens-ulitmate-frisbee-tournament-to-be-sponsored-by-refex-group/','PRESS RELEASE',7995,'press',0,1,'2025-12-24 09:53:21','2025-12-24 10:24:53','2025-12-24 00:00:00');
