INSERT INTO `section_contents` VALUES (1,1,'title','About Refex','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-18 17:27:06'),(2,1,'subtitle','Refex Group is a leading diversified business group with over 23 years of experience, committed to excellence, innovation, and sustainable growth across all our business verticals.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-16 04:50:53'),(3,1,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-gallery-20-th-anniversary-3-1766572722404-46321.jpg','text',8011,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-24 10:38:46'),(4,2,'heading','About Refex Groups','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-18 17:28:09'),(5,2,'description','Refex Group is among the leading business conglomerates of India and it has expanded during the past 2 decades of its operation across multiple business verticals – Renewables (Solar & Wind IPP), Chemicals (refilling of environment friendly refrigerant gases), Medical Technologies (manufacturing Digital X-rays, Flat Panel Detectors, and refurbishing MRI machines), Pharma (API manufacturing pertaining to the Central Nervous System), Green Mobility (offering 4 wheeler EV as a technology backed service), Ash handling (mitigating environmental pollution from the thermal power plants by handling the ash), and Airport operations among other such business verticals. At present, there are 2 publicly listed entities (listed in the stock exchanges of India) under the umbrella of the Group – Refex Industries Limited and Refex Renewables & Infrastructure Limited. The company’s excellent reputation and trust in the industry is due to its commitment to core values such as integrity, diversity, dedication, commitment, and competitiveness.\n\nRefex Holding Private Limited along with its associate companies, sister companies, and their subsidiaries form part of the Refex Group.\n\nRefex Group’s growth mindset is its biggest strength, which has allowed it to stay ahead of the competition by seizing emerging opportunities. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and continuous improvement, Refex Group has been able to provide superior value to all its stakeholders.\n\nThe company’s culture of excellence has helped us to attract the best talent, and its focus on growth, learning, and adaptability will continue to drive our success in the future. Refex Group’s commitment to leading by example and continuously improving while staying true to its values is a recipe for long-term success.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-30 10:36:51'),(6,2,'logo','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-logo-2x-8-1-1766573147103-811685.png','text',8016,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-24 10:46:23'),(7,2,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-office-group-photo-comp-1-1024x576-1766573181694-443446.jpg','text',8017,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-24 10:46:23'),(8,3,'missionTitle','Our Mission','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-18 18:03:45'),(9,3,'missionText','Refex shall create enduring value across industries through innovation, operational excellence, and sustainable practices, thereby empowering our customers, enriching our communities, and delivering responsible growth for all stakeholders.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-18 18:03:45'),(10,3,'visionTitle','Our Vision','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-18 18:03:45'),(11,3,'visionText','Refex aims to be a globally admired conglomerate, driving long-term sustainable growth through innovation, purposeful collaborations and partnerships, and an unwavering commitment to excellence, while contributing meaningfully to societal progress. ','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-18 18:03:45'),(12,3,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-vision-mission-bg-1766577436078-716346.jpg','text',8047,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-24 11:57:19'),(13,4,'heading','Our Story','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-16 04:50:53'),(14,4,'description','Discover the journey of Refex Group from its humble beginnings to becoming a leading diversified business conglomerate. Our story is one of resilience, innovation, and unwavering commitment to excellence. ','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-18 18:05:00'),(15,4,'timeline','[{\"year\":\"2002\",\"title\":\"Foundation\",\"description\":\"Refex Group was founded, marking the beginning of our journey.\"},{\"year\":\"2005\",\"title\":\"Expansion\",\"description\":\"Diversified into multiple business verticals including refrigerants and renewables.\"},{\"year\":\"2010\",\"title\":\"Growth\",\"description\":\"Established strong presence in medical technologies and pharma sectors.\"},{\"year\":\"2015\",\"title\":\"Innovation\",\"description\":\"Launched green mobility solutions and enhanced sustainability initiatives.\"},{\"year\":\"2020\",\"title\":\"Milestone\",\"description\":\"Celebrated 20 years of excellence and continued expansion.\"},{\"year\":\"2024\",\"title\":\"Future\",\"description\":\"Continuing to lead with innovation, sustainability, and growth mindset.\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-16 04:50:53'),(16,4,'timelineImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-milestone-only-year-1-1766577660016-121707.png','text',8048,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-24 12:01:02'),(17,5,'title','Join Refex Group and grow, learn, and thrive in your career.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-16 04:50:53'),(18,5,'description','Join our dynamic and driven team at Refex, where passion, self-motivation and a desire for growth are valued!','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-16 04:50:53'),(19,5,'buttonText','Explore Careers','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-16 04:50:53'),(20,5,'buttonLink','/careers','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-16 04:50:53'),(21,5,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-home-career-bg-1766577701748-988105.jpg','text',8049,'2025-12-16 04:50:53','2025-12-24 12:01:43'),(22,6,'title','ESG','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-21 03:57:12'),(23,6,'subtitle','At Refex, we\'re constantly changing from the inside to change the world outside. Learn how our business strives to make a difference.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(24,6,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-esg-banner-1766636078583-188825.jpg','text',8065,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 04:14:42'),(25,7,'heading','At Refex Group, we believe in creating a better world through sustainable business practices. We prioritize People, Planet, and Profit equally and are committed to becoming an ESG champion and carbon-neutral company.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(26,7,'description','By aligning with the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals, we are taking action towards a brighter future. We invite you to join hands with Refex Group in our efforts towards sustainability and make a positive impact on the world!','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(27,7,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-esg-images-refex-9-1766636115719-854978.jpg','text',8066,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 04:15:50'),(28,7,'logo','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-logo-2x-8-1-1766636145697-645037.png','text',8067,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 04:15:50'),(29,8,'title','Championing for Change','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-21 04:02:36'),(30,8,'description','We take our responsibility to the planet and society seriously, and we strive to be a force for good in everything we do. Our commitment to making a positive impact is reflected in our approach to corporate social responsibility, and we work tirelessly to create a better future for generations to come. Join us in our mission to make a meaningful difference in the world. ','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-21 04:02:37'),(31,8,'backgroundColor','#7DC144','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(32,8,'textColor','white','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(33,8,'backgroundPattern','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-esg-dot-pattern-small-1766636245391-926945.png','text',8068,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 04:17:28'),(34,9,'pillars','[{\"title\":\"Environment\",\"description\":\"At Refex, we\'re deeply committed to protecting the planet. We use eco-friendly technology, conserve precious resources, and restore ecosystems to make a positive impact. Join us in creating a better world for all!\",\"image\":8389,\"order\":0,\"link\":\"\",\"orderIndex\":0,\"id\":\"pillar-0-1766668143700\"},{\"title\":\"Health & Safety\",\"description\":\"At Refex, safety is our #1 priority with mission zero harm. We\'re committed to providing a safe workplace for all, including employees, visitors, and workers, and we\'re proud of our perfect record with zero fatalities and disabilities!\",\"image\":8390,\"order\":1,\"id\":\"pillar-1-1766668143700\",\"orderIndex\":1,\"link\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate Social Responsibility\",\"description\":\"We\'re committed to creating social value and making a positive impact in the lives of marginalized groups through our CSR activities. Our guiding principles of transparency and accountability ensure that we\'re making a real difference.\",\"image\":8391,\"order\":2,\"id\":\"pillar-2-1766668143700\",\"orderIndex\":2,\"link\":\"\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-26 07:10:38'),(35,10,'heading','ESG Policies','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(36,10,'qualityPolicyTitle','Quality Policy','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(37,10,'qualityPolicyUrl','/uploads/documents/Quality-Policy.pdf','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-30 05:00:53'),(38,10,'ehsPolicyTitle','EHS Policy','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(39,10,'ehsPolicyUrl','/uploads/documents/EHS-Policy.pdf','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-30 04:58:21'),(40,10,'sustainabilityPolicyTitle','Sustainability Policy','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(41,10,'sustainabilityPolicyUrl','/uploads/documents/Sustainability-ESG-Policy.pdf','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-30 04:58:21'),(42,10,'otherPoliciesHeading','Other Policies','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(43,10,'grievancePolicyTitle','Grievance Policy','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(44,10,'grievancePolicyUrl','/uploads/documents/Grievance-Policy.pdf','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-30 04:58:21'),(45,10,'abacPolicyTitle','Signed ABAC Policy','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(46,10,'abacPolicyUrl','/uploads/documents/Anti-Bribery-Anti-Corruption-ABAC-Policy.pdf','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-30 04:58:21'),(47,10,'vendorCodeTitle','Signed Supplier Vendor Code of Conduct','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(48,10,'vendorCodeUrl','/uploads/documents/Vendor-Code-of-Conduct.pdf','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-30 04:58:21'),(49,11,'tabs','[{\"tabId\":\"environment\",\"title\":\"Environment\",\"description\":\"At Refex, we\'re committed to safeguarding our planet\'s natural resources through strategic policies and a robust environmental management system. We prioritize eco-friendly technologies in all of our operations, and constantly strive to make our businesses more sustainable. We\'re passionate about conserving resources, reducing carbon emissions, conserving water, and restoring ecosystems to their natural states.\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-esg-images-refex2-1766731226546-404249.jpg\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Renewable Energy\",\"description\":\"Our renewable energy business aims to provide affordable solar energy to private and government agencies, and we have established our solar foothold in the Himalayas with our prestigious client BSF.\"},{\"title\":\"Waste Management & Material Circularity\",\"description\":\"Refex provides eco-friendly disposal and management of coal ash for thermal power plants, establishing a robust business network of manufacturers, contractors, and abandoned mine owners to maximize recycling in an environmentally-friendly way.\"},{\"title\":\"Ecosystem Restoration and Plantation Drive\",\"description\":\"We prioritize biodiversity conservation and ecosystem restoration through plantation drives, barren land rehabilitation, and agro-farming practices, initiating a program \\\"Trees For Life\\\" to plant and nurture 100,000 saplings over the next 10 years.\"},{\"title\":\"Water Stewardship\",\"description\":\"We aim to be water positive by 2030 by reducing freshwater demand through recycling, rainwater harvesting, and ground recharge at our sites and facility offices, prioritizing wise and judicious use of water resources.\"}]},{\"tabId\":\"health\",\"title\":\"Health & Safety\",\"description\":\"We\'re dedicated to achieving mission zero harm, prioritizing a safe workplace and the physical and mental well-being of our entire workforce. Our Occupational Health and Safety Management System (OHSMS) adheres to ISO 45001:2018, and we\'re proud to report zero fatalities or permanent disabilities to date.\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-esg-images-refex6-1766639384319-550476.jpg\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Vamika\",\"description\":\"Refex has established an internal networking forum called \'Vamika\' to provide physical, mental and career wellness support to women, including safety needs addressed through self-defense workshops and a \\\"Wellness Work-from-Home policy\\\".\"},{\"title\":\"Mental Health Awareness\",\"description\":\"Refex recognizes the importance of mental health and has initiated a program of mental health awareness for its employees through regular sessions with mental wellness experts.\"},{\"title\":\"Basic Health Surveillance\",\"description\":\"Refex has implemented regular basic health screening for its staff and workers engaged in high-risk activities to identify and manage workplace-related incidents caused by poor health conditions.\"},{\"title\":\"Safety Training\",\"description\":\"Regular safety training programs and drills are conducted to ensure all employees are well-prepared to handle emergency situations and maintain a safe working environment.\"}]},{\"tabId\":\"csr\",\"title\":\"Corporate Social Responsibility\",\"description\":\"At Refex, we believe in creating social value by giving back to the community. Our CSR activities are managed with the highest transparency, oversight, and impact assessment, focusing on four thematic areas. We strive for a sustainable business model connected with society to contribute to the underprivileged and marginalized sections.\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-esg-images-refex7-1766639400929-110981.jpg\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Water and Sanitation\",\"description\":\"Providing potable water through \\\"Nirmal Jal\\\" program and maintaining water supply network to ensure clean water access for communities.\"},{\"title\":\"Ecosystem Restoration\",\"description\":\"Planting 100,000 trees, rehabilitating abandoned mines, and offering land and water for crop cultivation to support sustainable agriculture.\"},{\"title\":\"Child Education and Skill Training\",\"description\":\"Donating refurbished laptops and providing computer literacy to local school children to enhance their educational opportunities.\"},{\"title\":\"Primary Healthcare\",\"description\":\"3i MedTech offers affordable medical diagnosis and imaging services using frugal innovation and portable technology for underserved communities.\"}]}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-31 10:59:09'),(50,12,'sustainabilityReportTitle','Sustainability Report','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(51,12,'sustainabilityReportButtonText','Refex Sustainability Report FY2023-24','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(52,12,'sustainabilityReportUrl','https://www.refex.group/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Sustainability-Report-2023-24.pdf','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-30 05:25:56'),(53,12,'dashboardTitle','ESG Performance Dashboard','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(54,12,'dashboardButtonText','ESG Performance Dashboard','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(55,12,'dashboardUrl','/uploads/documents/ESG_Dashboard_FY-24-25.pdf','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-30 05:06:07'),(56,12,'overlayColor','#2d5234','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(57,12,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-esg-report-bg-1766636474341-116238.jpg','text',8072,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 04:21:19'),(58,13,'heading','Sustainable Development Goals','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(59,13,'description1','We\'re all about making the world a better place! We\'re committed to working with India and the UN to achieve United Nations Sustainable Development Goals, because we know that together we can make a big difference. We\'re not just focused on making our shareholders happy – we\'re all about creating value for everyone involved, including the planet!','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(60,13,'description2','We\'re so proud to be a member of UNGC and to be working with partners around the world to make the world a better place. We\'re all about ethical business practices and doing our part to solve some of the biggest challenges of our time. Let\'s make the world a better place, together!','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(61,13,'backgroundColor','#7cb342','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(62,13,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-sdg-image-hero-large1-1766636530980-929385.jpeg','text',8073,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 04:22:14'),(63,14,'heading','Governance','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 05:26:47'),(64,14,'description','Our corporate governance culture is rock solid, with strong risk resilience and a value creation model that can\'t be beat. We\'re all about inclusivity, with policies and procedures that are comprehensive and robust, and we\'ve got a monitoring and grievance mechanism that really works. Join us in our mission to make the world a better place!','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 05:26:47'),(65,14,'quote','The environment is where we all meet; where we all have a mutual interest; it is the one thing all of us share.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 05:26:47'),(66,14,'quoteAuthor','- Lady Bird Johnson.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-31 12:05:04'),(67,14,'missionTitle','Our Mission','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 05:26:47'),(68,14,'missionDescription','Refex shall create enduring value across industries through innovation, operational excellence, and sustainable practices, thereby empowering our customers, enriching our communities, and delivering responsible growth for all stakeholders.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-31 12:06:26'),(69,14,'visionTitle','Our Vision','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 05:26:47'),(70,14,'visionDescription','Refex aims to be a globally admired conglomerate, driving long-term sustainable growth through innovation, purposeful collaborations and partnerships, and an unwavering commitment to excellence, while contributing meaningfully to societal progress.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-31 12:06:26'),(71,14,'coreValuesHeading','Our Core Values','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 05:26:47'),(72,14,'coreValuesSubtitle','Refex\'s core values have always been the foundation of our guiding principles.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-25 05:26:47'),(73,14,'coreValues','[{\"title\":\"Principled Excellence\",\"description\":\"Doing what’s right, with integrity and intention.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-customercentricapproach-1766640538839-845124.svg\",\"letter\":\"P\"},{\"title\":\"Authenticity\",\"description\":\"Bringing your true self to work, and honouring that in others.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-exemplaryleadership-1766640563255-663928.svg\",\"letter\":\"A\"},{\"title\":\"Customer Value\",\"description\":\"Keeping our customers at the heart of everything we do.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-ethicalconduct-1766640664199-93359.svg\",\"letter\":\"C\"},{\"title\":\"Esteem Culture\",\"description\":\"Fostering a workplace where respect, dignity, and belonging are everyday experiences.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-fairness-1766640680908-324719.svg\",\"letter\":\"E\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-31 12:05:05'),(74,15,'questionTitle','Got a question? xgfxfh','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-21 11:36:34'),(75,15,'questionButtonText','Get in touch uyvfyuj','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-21 11:36:34'),(76,15,'questionButtonLink','/contact','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(77,15,'newsTitle','See our latest news thc jgou','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-21 11:36:34'),(78,15,'newsButtonText','Refex Newsroom yufctujfy','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-21 11:36:34'),(79,15,'newsButtonLink','/newsroom','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(80,15,'careersTitle','Work at Refex ygvkyog','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-21 11:36:34'),(81,15,'careersButtonText','Careers iugbku','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-21 11:36:34'),(82,15,'careersButtonLink','/careers','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(83,15,'backgroundColor','#3b9dd6','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 05:23:26','2025-12-16 05:23:26'),(84,16,'title','Investments','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-19 05:12:40'),(85,16,'description','Unlock Your Financial Potential: Explore Our Diverse Range of Investment Opportunities and Discover a World of Possibilities','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-19 05:12:56'),(86,16,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-investments-e1677567598400-1766656351605-280803.jpg','text',8108,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-25 09:52:36'),(87,17,'title','Grow your finances into success by investing in Refex Group through multiple stakeholder options','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-19 05:29:57'),(88,17,'logo','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-logo-2x-8-1-1766656379875-782526.png','text',8109,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-25 09:53:02'),(89,18,'title','Message from Anil Jain','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-19 10:31:54'),(90,18,'position','Chairman & Managing Director','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-19 10:31:54'),(91,18,'content','[\"Proud to say that our success is a result of our strong risk-taking ability and our dedicated team who follow best practices in risk mitigation. We are committed to continuously adapting to the changing business environment and staying ahead of the curve through our focus on macro-trends and innovation.\",\"Our commitment to being environmentally, socially, and governance (ESG) compliant is at the forefront of all our business decisions and will continue to drive our success in the future.\"]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-19 10:31:54'),(92,18,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-anil-1766656408444-798484.png','text',8110,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-25 09:53:31'),(93,19,'title','Our Listed Companies','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-16 06:04:24'),(94,19,'description','Stay on top of the game with the up-to-date listings of our leading companies listed on India\'s renowned BSE and NSE stock exchanges.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-16 06:04:24'),(95,19,'companies','[{\"name\":\"REFEX\",\"bse\":{\"price\":\"₹ 324.45\",\"change\":\"-0.23%\",\"trend\":\"down\"},\"nse\":{\"price\":\"₹ 323.35\",\"change\":\"-0.51%\",\"trend\":\"down\"}},{\"name\":\"REFEXRENEW\",\"bse\":{\"price\":\"₹ 390.85\",\"change\":\"-5.0%\",\"trend\":\"down\"},\"nse\":null}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-25 05:17:07'),(96,19,'disclaimer','The live stock price information on this website is provided by a third-party vendor, and we are not responsible for any delays or inaccuracies in the data provided. Please use this information at your own risk','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-16 06:04:24'),(97,20,'text','For any other information related to investing, get in touch with us at','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-16 06:04:24'),(98,20,'email','info@refex.co.in','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-16 06:04:24'),(99,21,'backgroundColor','#3b9dd6','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-16 06:04:24'),(100,21,'cards','[{\"title\":\"Got a question?\",\"buttonText\":\"Get in touch\",\"buttonLink\":\"/contact\"},{\"title\":\"See our latest news\",\"buttonText\":\"Refex Newsroom\",\"buttonLink\":\"/newsroom\"},{\"title\":\"Work at Refex\",\"buttonText\":\"Careers\",\"buttonLink\":\"/careers\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:04:24','2025-12-19 10:42:26'),(101,22,'title','Get in touch with us for any questions, comments, or business inquiries.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-16 06:17:26'),(102,22,'officeTitle','CORPORATE OFFICE','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-16 06:17:26'),(103,22,'companyName','Refex Group','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-16 06:17:26'),(104,22,'address','[\"Refex Building,\",\"67, Bazullah Road,\",\"Parthasarathy Puram, T Nagar\",\"Chennai – 600017\"]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-16 06:17:26'),(105,22,'phone','044 – 4340 5900/950','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-16 06:17:26'),(106,22,'email','info@refex.co.in','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-16 06:17:26'),(107,22,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/Contact-Page-Bg.jpg','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-23 17:24:39'),(108,23,'title','Get In Touch','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-16 06:17:26'),(109,23,'description','We welcome your questions, comments, and business inquiries.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-16 06:17:26'),(110,23,'mapUrl','https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Refex%20Group%2C%20Chennai&t=m&z=10&output=embed&iwloc=near','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-16 06:17:26'),(111,24,'backgroundColor','linear-gradient(to right, #3b8ac6, #4a9fd8)','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-16 06:17:26'),(112,24,'cards','[{\"title\":\"See our latest news\",\"buttonText\":\"Refex Newsroom\",\"buttonLink\":\"/newsroom\"},{\"title\":\"Work at Refex\",\"buttonText\":\"Careers\",\"buttonLink\":\"/careers\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:17:26','2025-12-16 06:17:26'),(113,25,'title','Diversity & Inclusion','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-25 14:07:17'),(114,25,'description','Where differences are celebrated and all voices are heard, that\'s our commitment to diversity and inclusion.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-25 14:07:17'),(115,25,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-diversity-inclusion-page-title-1766671753523-157854.jpg','text',8151,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-25 14:09:15'),(116,26,'title','Be YOU at work','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-25 14:07:34'),(117,26,'content','[\"Refex provides equal and fair employment opportunities to all eligible applicants for employment across the Group companies, in compliance with all applicable laws, thereby prohibiting any form of discrimination or harassment against any applicant or employee. This includes, and is not limited to discrimination based on age, race, color, gender, national origin, religion, creed, disability, sexual orientation, ancestry, gender identity, marital status, pregnancy, citizenship status, political view or activity and/or any other ground or reason whatsoever. This is applicable to all employee actions, including but not limited to recruitment, hiring, placement, promotion, transfer, separation, compensation, benefits, training, education. Refex makes hiring decisions based solely on qualifications, merit and business requirements/needs only.\",\"At Refex, we create a work environment where all employees learn and grow in their career journey and put their maximum efforts to achieve their fullest potential. We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to diversity and inclusion at workplace and also maintaining respect and dignity for all.\"]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-25 14:07:34'),(118,26,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-5201-1-2048x1367-1766671834386-751019.jpg','text',8152,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-25 14:10:37'),(119,27,'title','What we believe in!','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-20 14:06:44'),(120,27,'beliefs','[{\"title\":\"Equal Opportunities\",\"description\":\"Providing equal employment opportunities without discrimination or bias.\",\"orderIndex\":0,\"iconPath\":8156},{\"title\":\"Diversity and Inclusion\",\"description\":\"Maintaining a workplace culture that values diversity and inclusiveness.\",\"orderIndex\":1,\"iconPath\":8417},{\"title\":\"Respect\",\"description\":\"Treating all employees fairly and with respect, regardless of personal characteristics.\",\"orderIndex\":2,\"iconPath\":8416}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-26 09:11:45'),(121,28,'title','Initiatives at Refex Group','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-16 06:27:54'),(122,28,'description','We are dedicated to creating a positive impact on the lives of our employees, customers, and the communities we serve, and will continue to strive towards this goal.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-16 06:27:54'),(123,28,'sliderImages','[8418,8419,8158,8159,8160]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-26 09:20:59'),(124,28,'vamika','{\"logo\":\"/uploads/logos/Vamika-Logo.png\",\"description\":\"Refex has created an internal networking forum called \'Vamika\' that prioritizes the career, physical, and mental wellness support of women. The initiative emphasizes the well-being of women and aims to promote their health.\",\"images\":[\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Vamika-Wellness-REFEX-1.jpg\",\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Vamika-Wellness-REFEX-2.jpg\",\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Vamika-Wellness-REFEX-3.jpg\",\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Vamika-Wellness-REFEX-4.jpg\"]}','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-16 06:27:54'),(125,28,'kravMaga','{\"logo\":\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Kravamaga.png\",\"description\":\"Refex has taken a proactive step towards addressing women\'s safety by organizing a self-defense workshop called \'Krav Maga.\' The workshop, which was available to all women, aimed to equip them with the necessary skills to protect themselves.\",\"images\":[\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Krav-Maga-REFEX-1.jpg\",\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Krav-Maga-REFEX-2.jpg\",\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Krav-Maga-REFEX-4.jpg\",\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Krav-Maga-REFEX-6.jpg\",\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Krav-Maga-REFEX-7.jpg\",\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Krav-Maga-REFEX-10.jpg\",\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Krav-Maga-REFEX-11.jpg\",\"/uploads/diversity-inclusion/initiatives/Krav-Maga-REFEX-12.jpg\"]}','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-16 06:27:54'),(126,29,'backgroundColor','linear-gradient(to right, #3b9dd6, #4db3e8)','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-16 06:27:54'),(127,29,'cards','[{\"title\":\"Got a question?\",\"buttonText\":\"Get in touch\",\"buttonLink\":\"/contact\"},{\"title\":\"See our latest news\",\"buttonText\":\"Refex Newsroom\",\"buttonLink\":\"/newsroom\"},{\"title\":\"Work at Refex\",\"buttonText\":\"Careers\",\"buttonLink\":\"/careers\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:27:54','2025-12-16 06:27:54'),(128,30,'title','Careers','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(129,30,'description','Join Our Team and Make an Impact: Discover Your Next Career Opportunity at Refex Group','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(130,30,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-people-group-careers-1766670525913-559361.jpg','text',8138,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-25 13:48:58'),(131,31,'title','Refex fosters a supportive and welcoming community for all.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(132,31,'paragraph1','Refex is dedicated to creating a workplace where employees can expand their skills and reach their full potential. We believe in equality and value diversity, fostering a respectful and inclusive environment for all employees.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(133,31,'paragraph2','At Refex Group, we are proud of the diverse and talented team of professionals who make our company a leading business conglomerate. Our employees come from a wide range of backgrounds and bring unique perspectives to the table, allowing us to continue to innovate and excel in our various business sectors including refrigerant gas, renewables, venture capital, power trading, thermal – ash and coal handling, thermal – power generation and health care.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(134,32,'videoUrl','https://www.youtube.com/embed/Exp79B_pL9I','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(135,33,'title','Life as A #Refexian','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(136,33,'description','We\'re Nurturing Diversity, Embracing Inclusion, Igniting Passion, and Fostering Growth.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(137,33,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-image-20-1766670658479-450183.png','text',8139,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-25 13:51:00'),(138,34,'title','Why choose Refex?','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(139,34,'features','[{\"icon\":\"/uploads/media/8145\",\"title\":\"Nurturing Talent\",\"description\":\"Harnessing the power of potential, our extensive training program is dedicated to identifying and nurturing talent to reach new heights.\"},{\"icon\":\"/uploads/media/8146\",\"title\":\"Culture & Inclusion\",\"description\":\"Working towards creating a workplace where everyone feels valued and has equal opportunities for success.\"},{\"icon\":\"/uploads/media/8147\",\"title\":\"Center of Excellence\",\"description\":\"Investing in the growth and development of our employees to drive long-term success for both individuals and the company.\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-25 14:04:23'),(140,35,'title','Make a Difference','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(141,35,'subtitle','Shape Your Future with Refex','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(142,35,'formTitle','Apply now','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(143,35,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-careers-bg-2-1766670853018-167708.jpg','text',8140,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-25 13:54:15'),(144,36,'title','What our employees say about us','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(145,36,'paragraph1','At Refex we value employee input and foster a supportive work environment where open communication is encouraged. We believe our employees\' perspectives drive company success. It\'s a privilege to be part of a company that values its team.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(146,36,'paragraph2','At Refex, ESOP isn\'t just a financial benefit; it\'s a catalyst for life-changing milestones. For many Refexians, it has helped close long-term loans, support children\'s education, and even secure land for future homes. These stories reflect our belief in shared growth and the power of true ownership.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(147,36,'paragraph3','Hear from Refexians as they share their ESOP journeys…','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(148,37,'title','Want to know more about Refex?','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(149,37,'buttonText','Go to About Refex','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(150,37,'buttonLink','/about-refex','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(151,38,'images','[8141,8142,8143,8144]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-25 13:55:32'),(152,39,'backgroundColor','linear-gradient(to right, #3b9dd6, #4db3e8)','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(153,39,'cards','[{\"title\":\"Got a question?\",\"buttonText\":\"Get in touch\",\"buttonLink\":\"/contact\"},{\"title\":\"See our latest news\",\"buttonText\":\"Refex Newsroom\",\"buttonLink\":\"/newsroom\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 06:43:52','2025-12-16 06:43:52'),(154,40,'tagline','Refex Renewables','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 15:19:32'),(155,40,'title','Brightening the future with renewables','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 15:19:32'),(156,40,'description','Your trusted partner in renewable energy. With 10 years of experience in the solar PV industry, we specialize in designing, executing, installing, and maintaining efficient solar power systems.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 15:19:32'),(157,40,'buttonText','Explore','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 15:19:32'),(158,40,'buttonLink','#explore','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-16 07:03:55'),(159,40,'stat1Value','10','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 17:51:03'),(160,40,'stat1Label','YEARS OF EXPERIENCE','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 15:19:32'),(161,40,'stat2Value','41','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 17:51:03'),(162,40,'stat2Label','LOCATIONS','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 15:19:32'),(163,40,'stat3Value','12','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 17:51:03'),(164,40,'stat3Label','ACROSS STATES','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 15:19:32'),(165,40,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-renewables-projects-leh-ladak-2-1766685022505-906862.jpg','text',8187,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 17:50:27'),(166,41,'categories','[{\"title\":\"Commercial & Industrial\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-renewables-projects-bhilai-2-1766685189676-764662.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Utility\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-diwana-2-medium-1766685212357-106047.jpeg\"},{\"title\":\"Battery storage\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-battery-storage-large-1766685233498-159341.jpeg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-31 10:08:40'),(167,42,'title','Discover the numerous benefits that set us apart from the competition','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 15:21:05'),(168,42,'benefits','[{\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-expertteam-1766685273578-327392.svg\",\"title\":\"Expert Team\",\"description\":\"Our expert team excels in the solar industry, with proven success and unparalleled knowledge. We offer clients tailored, efficient solutions.\"},{\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-holisticsolutions-1766685283956-886367.svg\",\"title\":\"Holistic Solutions\",\"description\":\"We provide a holistic approach to our services, including design, installation, and maintenance, making the process simple and straightforward for our clients.\"},{\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-sustainableenergy-1766685294130-887573.svg\",\"title\":\"Sustainable Energy\",\"description\":\"Refex Renewables provides eco-friendly energy solutions for a better future. Our goal is to promote renewable sources of energy for a cleaner planet.\"},{\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-extensivecoverage-1766685305329-3276.svg\",\"title\":\"Extensive Coverage\",\"description\":\"Refex Renewables has successfully executed projects across multiple regions, showcasing our capacity to serve a diverse population.\"},{\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-recordexcellence-1766685320252-893764.svg\",\"title\":\"Record of Excellence\",\"description\":\"Our reputation precedes us, thanks to a portfolio that includes prestigious government agencies and top-notch private organizations.\"},{\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-innovativestrategist-1766685331571-974094.svg\",\"title\":\"Innovative Strategies\",\"description\":\"Refex Renewables is renowned for our groundbreaking methods in solar power systems, such as the canal top solar venture, making us stand out among the competition.\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 17:55:34'),(169,43,'title','Featured Projects','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-16 07:03:55'),(170,43,'description','Explore our featured projects and discover how Refex is leading the way in sustainable innovation and excellence.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-16 07:03:55'),(171,43,'projects','[{\"id\":\"bhilai\",\"name\":\"Bhilai Project\",\"location\":\"Bhilai, Chhattisgarh\",\"capacity\":\"68MWp\",\"description\":\"Ongoing Project.\",\"details\":\"Off-taker – Indian Railways – AAA rated 1st solar project.\",\"images\":[8924,8199,8200,8201]},{\"id\":\"indian-army\",\"name\":\"Indian Army 2 MW Project\",\"location\":\"Leh, Ladakh (Partapur & Siachen Base Camps)\",\"capacity\":\"2 MWp with 4 MWhr of BSES\",\"description\":\"Solar project at the highest altitude in India\",\"details\":\"Project Completed in July 2022.\",\"extraDetails\":\"Name of off-taker – Indian Army\",\"images\":[8205,8206,8207,8208]},{\"id\":\"diwana\",\"name\":\"Diwana Project\",\"location\":\"Panipat, Haryana\",\"capacity\":\"2.938 MWp\",\"description\":\"1st solar project alongside the railway track\",\"details\":\"Project Completed in September 2020.\",\"extraDetails\":\"Name of off-taker – Indian Railways- AAA rated\",\"images\":[8209,8210,8211,8212]}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-31 12:20:30'),(172,43,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-renewables-projects-leh-ladak-3-1766685574032-995676.jpg','text',8202,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 17:59:40'),(173,44,'title','Refex Renewables & Infrastructure Limited','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 15:21:47'),(174,44,'description','Building a better world with clean energy and sustainable infrastructure.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 15:21:47'),(175,44,'buttonText','Visit Website','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 15:21:47'),(176,44,'buttonLink','https://www.refex.group/refex-renewables/','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-16 07:03:55'),(177,44,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-diwana-3-medium-1766685125468-406519.jpeg','text',8188,'2025-12-16 07:03:55','2025-12-25 17:52:09'),(178,45,'tagline','Refex Ash Utilization & Coal Handling','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2026-01-01 07:25:19'),(179,45,'title','Refex – One-stop solution for all your Ash and Coal Requirements','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-25 15:22:15'),(180,45,'description','Refex is the leading provider of specialized solutions for the seamless supply and transportation of coal, management of the coal yard, efficient transportation and disposal of ash generated from the incineration of coal in thermal power plants. Operational since 2018, we have built a reputation for providing out of the box and reliable solutions and high-quality services to our clients. We have come to known as the most dependable and competent service provider for a multitude of services in the thermal business spectrum.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-25 15:22:15'),(181,45,'buttonText','Explore','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-25 15:22:15'),(182,45,'buttonLink','#explore','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-16 07:13:06'),(183,45,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-coal-heap-at-yard-7-2-large-1766686809443-752847.jpeg','text',8214,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-25 18:20:11'),(184,46,'heading','Why us','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-25 15:23:16'),(185,46,'description','At Refex, we take immense pride in our commitment to excellence, sustainability and environmental responsibility. We work closely with each individual client to understand their specific needs and deliver customized solutions. Whether you\'re looking for a reliable source of high-quality coal or need a partner to handle your ash transportation and disposal needs, we have the expertise and experience to deliver results as per the standards set by MoEF (Ministry of Environment, Forest and Climate Change of India) and the pollution control boards.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-25 15:23:16'),(186,47,'heading','What We do','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-25 15:23:46'),(187,47,'description','We offer a comprehensive suite of services across ash handling, coal yard management and coal trading. From ash collection, transportation and disposal to recycling and reuse options, our experienced team uses state-of-the-art equipment and techniques to ensure safe and responsible handling in compliance with all relevant regulations. We provide round the clock, cost effective and sustainable services for management of coal yards in thermal power plants, including CHP room operations, housekeeping, segregation of coal & stone, management of heavy machineries, rake unloading, shifting and crushing of coal etc. Our coal trading services cover sourcing, procurement and transportation of various types of coal through a trusted network of suppliers, ensuring high quality products delivered on time and within budget.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-16 07:13:06'),(188,48,'title','Refex Industries Limited','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-25 15:24:01'),(189,48,'description','Reliable and Trusted partner for Ash & Coal handling','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-25 15:24:01'),(190,48,'buttonText','Visit Website','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-25 15:24:01'),(191,48,'buttonLink','https://www.refex.group/','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-31 10:12:25'),(192,48,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-heap-making-1766687245878-717522.jpeg','text',8219,'2025-12-16 07:13:06','2025-12-25 18:27:28'),(193,46,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-pushing-at-th2-1766686844168-490185.jpeg','text',8215,'2025-12-16 09:09:04','2025-12-25 18:20:46'),(194,46,'features','[{\"title\":\"Innovative Solutions\",\"description\":\"Refex is at the forefront in adopting innovative technologies in the utilization of ash in various environmental-friendly and new generation methods of ash usage / disposal. Constantly on the lookout for opportunities for recycling and reuse to minimize waste and reduce our clients\' environmental footprint.\",\"iconPath\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-innovative-solutions-1766687296642-721415.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Synergy with Cement Companies\",\"description\":\"Cordial relationships with all leading cement plants across the country, catering fly ash to them via multiple modes of transport, namely bulkers, rakes etc.\",\"iconPath\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-synergywithcement-1766687321137-506379.svg\"},{\"title\":\"100% Compliance to environmental norms\",\"description\":\"Refex adheres to statutory guidelines from all relevant organizations MoEF (Ministry of Environment, Forest & Climate Change), CPCB, and SPCB, with a commitment to create sustainable and compliant utilization or disposal methods.\",\"iconPath\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-100compliance-1766687339902-919814.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Experienced and Agile team\",\"description\":\"Refex\'s team of experienced engineers, project managers, and technicians work closely with clients to understand their specific needs and develop customized solutions that meet their requirements. Highly focused on data-driven decision making and adoption of immediate corrective actions.\",\"iconPath\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-experiencedagileteam-1766687350090-175324.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Large Scale Operations\",\"description\":\"Refex handles all aspects of the ash dyke, right from loading at the pond to the appropriate disposal and closure at landfills with complete documentation and compliance to statutory norms, while prioritizing safety on all accounts. Expertise in handling large scale MW projects and high ash volumes on a daily basis, with the extensive fleet of hyvas and trailers owned by Refex.\",\"iconPath\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-largescale-1766687359977-943488.svg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:09:04','2025-12-25 18:29:23'),(195,47,'flyAshDescription','We specialize in ash handling services, including ash collection, transportation, and disposal, as well as recycling and reuse options. Our experienced team uses state-of-the-art equipment and techniques to ensure that ash is handled safely and responsibly, in compliance with all relevant regulations. Our team of experts are highly trained in complete gamut of operations and our equipment is outfitted with latest trends in technology to carry out all our processes effectively, thereby ensuring high quality services provided to all our clients – thermal plants, cement companies, brick manufacturers, mine owners etc.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:23:02','2025-12-25 15:23:46'),(196,47,'coalYardDescription','We provide round the clock, cost effective and sustainable services for management of coal yards in thermal power plants, that includes CHP room operations, Housekeeping, Segregation of coal & stone, management of heavy machineries, Rake unloading, shifting and crushing of coal etc., thereby offering comprehensive support from procurement of coal to feeding it into boilers.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:23:02','2025-12-25 15:23:46'),(197,47,'coalTradingDescription','Our coal trading services includes sourcing, procurement, and transportation of various types of coal. We work with a network of trusted suppliers to ensure that our clients receive only the highest quality coal products, delivered on time and within budget. Our strategic partnerships, efficient supply chain management, and ability to navigate market fluctuations play a significant role in our success.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:23:02','2025-12-25 15:23:46'),(198,49,'title','“Affordable Luxury” with advanced cutting-edge technology','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-31 12:39:52'),(199,49,'subtitle','Creating extraordinary diagnostic tools and providing expert technical guidance to make healthcare affordable and accessible to all. ewgew','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-22 05:09:04'),(200,49,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-medtech-hero-banner-1766687458025-849848.jpg','text',8225,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-25 18:31:23'),(201,50,'heading','Overview','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(202,50,'description','Refex MedTech focuses on advanced diagnostic technologies and medical devices that improve patient outcomes while keeping healthcare affordable.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(203,51,'heading','Products','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(204,51,'description','Highlight key diagnostic products, imaging solutions and medical devices offered by Refex MedTech.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(205,52,'heading','Technology','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(206,52,'description','Explain the core technologies, innovation and R&D that power Refex MedTech solutions.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(207,53,'heading','Quality & Compliance','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(208,53,'description','Describe quality standards, certifications and regulatory compliance that ensure safe and reliable products.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(209,54,'heading','Applications','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(210,54,'description','Summarise key clinical and diagnostic applications where Refex MedTech products are used.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(211,55,'heading','Gallery','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(212,55,'description','Add images and visuals showcasing installations, products and use cases.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(213,56,'card1Title','Explore Refex MedTech asasf','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-22 05:18:26'),(214,56,'card1ButtonText','Visit Website afavcq','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-22 05:18:26'),(215,56,'card1ButtonLink','https://www.refexmedtech.com/','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 09:46:04','2025-12-16 09:46:04'),(216,57,'label','WE ADD ADWQDQ ','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-22 05:24:06'),(217,57,'title','GRIT AND GUMPTION TO YOUR GREAT IDEAS','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 15:27:03'),(218,57,'subtitle','Empowering Visionaries','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 15:27:03'),(219,57,'description','When dreamers and doers get together, clever ideas turn into revolutionary businesses.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 15:27:03'),(220,57,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-capital-hero-banner-white-1766689206476-34547.jpg','text',8276,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 19:00:09'),(221,58,'stats','[{\"value\":\"26\",\"suffix\":\"\",\"label\":\"Investee Companies\"},{\"value\":\"3\",\"suffix\":\"\",\"label\":\"Exits\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 19:00:34'),(222,59,'title','Know About Us dqqwf qfqdq','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-22 05:42:08'),(223,59,'description','At Refex Capital Fund, we believe in the potential of India to become a leading technology powerhouse in the near future. This conviction drives us to search for visionary entrepreneurs who are harnessing technology to create innovative products and services, disrupt the status quo, and forge new markets. Join us in our mission to support the next tech giant in India.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 15:27:39'),(224,59,'logo','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-logo-2x-8-1-1766689317377-369256.png','text',8280,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 19:01:59'),(225,59,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-capital-about-768x525-1766689267780-765235.jpg','text',8278,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 19:01:19'),(226,60,'title','OUR AREAS OF INTEREST','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 15:28:18'),(227,60,'description','We focus on investing in disruptive start-ups in the fields of AI, HealthTech, CleanTech, and Consumer sectors with the aim of advancing technology and defining the future.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 15:28:18'),(228,60,'areas','[{\"name\":\"HealthTech\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-health-tech-1766689378565-330018.svg\"},{\"name\":\"ConsumerTech\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-consumertech-1767281614083-617262.svg\"},{\"name\":\"CleanTech\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-cleantech-1767282516139-214669.svg\"},{\"name\":\"EnterpriseTech\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-enterprisetech-1767282527185-762161.svg\"},{\"name\":\"FinTech\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-fintech-1767282537334-593013.svg\"},{\"name\":\"DeepTech\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-deeptech-1766689447745-331463.svg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2026-01-01 15:49:01'),(229,60,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-capital-areas-bg-1-1766689366503-578913.jpg','text',8281,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 19:04:10'),(230,61,'title','What we look for?','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 15:28:48'),(231,61,'description','Our mission is to provide funding for Indian startups that are developing innovative products or services for the domestic market and have the potential to expand globally. We are particularly interested in companies that have a sustainable competitive advantage over the long term and a clear path to profitability. fqfq','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-22 05:46:55'),(232,61,'subtitle','When evaluating a startup, we look for the following key factors: ewww','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-22 05:46:55'),(233,61,'factors','[{\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-attractive-1766693259359-337810.svg\",\"title\":\"Attractiveness of opportunity & addressable market\"},{\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-team-capital-1766693270283-978438.svg\",\"title\":\"Team with passion, perseverance, relevant experience\"},{\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-use-of-tech-1766693280002-783500.svg\",\"title\":\"Use of technology to create an economic moat\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 20:08:02'),(234,62,'title','Our Portfolio','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 15:29:06'),(235,62,'subtitle','We give start-ups an unfair advantage','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 15:29:06'),(236,62,'portfolioLogos','[8335,8336,8360,8337,8339,8338,8340,8341,8342,8343,8345,8344,8346,8347,8348,8349,8350,8351,8352,8353,8354,8355,8356,8357,8358,8359]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-26 05:16:13'),(237,63,'title','Want to know more about how Refex Capital can help your business succeed?','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 15:29:21'),(238,63,'buttonText','Visit Website','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-25 15:29:21'),(239,63,'buttonLink','https://refexcapital.com/','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:03:38','2025-12-16 12:03:38'),(240,63,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-capital-logo-1767176856629-795647.png','text',8920,'2025-12-16 12:03:39','2025-12-31 10:27:38'),(241,64,'tagline','Refex Airports and Transportation','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2026-01-01 07:25:50'),(242,64,'title','Transforming Travel with Superior Retail Experiences.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:29:43'),(243,64,'description','Elevate your travel with our retail revolution. Refex Airports brings you the best in shopping, from global brands to unique finds, making every trip more than just a journey.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:29:43'),(244,64,'buttonText','Explore More','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:29:43'),(245,64,'buttonLink','#explore','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-16 12:28:53'),(246,64,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-airports-hero-1766692715968-714153.png','text',8323,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 19:58:38'),(247,64,'logoImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-airports-logo-w-1766692676242-814305.png','text',8322,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 19:58:38'),(248,65,'badge','About  Us','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:30:05'),(249,65,'heading','Revolutionizing retail experiences in air travel, Refex Airports brings a new dimension to your journey.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:30:05'),(250,65,'description','Refex Airports, at the forefront of transport innovation, is dedicated to revolutionizing the consumer journey across airports, railways, and more. We champion delightful travel experiences, operational excellence, and robust partnerships, underpinned by our core values: initiative, progress, unity, and transparency. Join us in redefining global travel.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:30:05'),(251,65,'imageCaption','Premier Retail Concessions at Pune and Srinagar Airports','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:30:05'),(252,65,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-airport-terminal-large-1024x683-1766692758401-591121.jpeg','text',8324,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 19:59:22'),(253,66,'title','FOR RETAIL PARTNERS','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:30:55'),(254,66,'gradientTitle','The Refex Difference in Travel Retail','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:30:55'),(255,66,'description','Experience a new era of airport retail with Refex Airports. Our unique approach combines the latest in retail innovation with a deep understanding of traveler needs, setting new standards in your journey\'s retail experience.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:30:55'),(256,66,'features','[{\"title\":\"Dedicated Onsite Management\",\"description\":\"Experience seamless operations with our dedicated Refex staff, prioritizing your success and bringing expertise to every detail of your retail venture.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dedicated-onsite-management-1766730255808-994458.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Exclusive Elegance in Retail\",\"description\":\"Elevate your brand with an exclusive collection, making your offerings an integral part of passengers\' premium journey.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-exclusive-elegance-in-retail-1766730234492-618503.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Optimal Investment Returns\",\"description\":\"Maximize returns with our strategically placed, high-traffic retail spaces designed for optimal profitability and investment efficiency.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-optimal-investment-returns-1766730266250-40612.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Brand Brilliance on Display\",\"description\":\"Illuminate your brand globally, enjoying unparalleled visibility that captivates diverse travelers. Join us, and let your brand shine.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-brand-brilliance-on-display-1766730281794-974239.svg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-26 06:24:47'),(257,66,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-airport-retail-1-1766692790848-250309.png','text',8325,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 19:59:54'),(258,67,'title','Discover the Refex Retail Advantage','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:31:11'),(259,67,'description','Redefine retail excellence with streamlined operations, a rich variety of stores, and a customer-centric approach for an unmatched shopping journey.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:31:11'),(260,67,'bullets','[\"Diverse Store Options\",\"Seamless Business Operations\",\"Strategic Layout for Visibility\",\"Exciting Shopping Experience\"]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-16 12:28:53'),(261,67,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-advantage-1-1766692819828-871141.jpg','text',8326,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 20:00:21'),(262,68,'title','Comprehensive Transportation Enhancement Initiatives','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:31:33'),(263,68,'description','Enhance consumer journeys across transportation platforms (airports, railways, metro systems, bus stations, heliports). Currently managing end-to-end design, finance, operation, and maintenance of Pune Airport outlets (May 2023) and Srinagar Airport (Oct 2023).','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:31:33'),(264,68,'cards','[{\"title\":\"Holistic Transportation Solutions\"},{\"title\":\"Airport Retail Management Expertise\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:31:33'),(265,68,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-airports-landing-page-hero-1-1766692848739-400659.png','text',8327,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 20:00:50'),(266,69,'title','Elevating Airport Retail Experience with Seamless Tech Integration','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:31:53'),(267,69,'description','Our commitment to enhancing customer experiences at airports extends to providing a future-forward, seamless retail and shopping journey for air travelers. Leveraging advanced technology, including the convenient pick-up of gifts and shopping items directly from our outlets, we ensure a modern and efficient shopping experience.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:31:53'),(268,69,'cards','[{\"title\":\"Customer-Centric Retail Enhancement \"},{\"title\":\"Seamless Tech-Driven Shopping Experience\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:31:53'),(269,69,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-airports-landing-page-hero-2-1766692879259-418653.png','text',8328,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 20:01:21'),(270,70,'title','Revolutionizing Airport Retail','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:32:08'),(271,70,'description','Discover how Refex Airports is pioneering a new era of retail in the airport environment, blending convenience with luxury.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:32:08'),(272,70,'buttonText','Visit Website','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 15:32:08'),(273,70,'buttonLink','https://refexairports.com/','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-16 12:28:53'),(274,70,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-refex-difference-02-1-1766692914616-722297.png','text',8329,'2025-12-16 12:28:53','2025-12-25 20:01:57'),(275,71,'titleHighlight','Refex Mobility:','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:32:28'),(276,71,'titleMain','Where reliability meets responsibility!','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:32:28'),(277,71,'description','Our cleaner-fuelled 4-wheeler fleet is transforming the way you commute, making every journey clean, safe and on time.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:32:28'),(278,71,'buttonText','Discover More','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:32:28'),(279,71,'buttonLink','/contact','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-16 12:33:17'),(280,71,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-top-banner-img-1766690123054-26063.png','text',8301,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 19:15:26'),(281,72,'badge','About Us','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:32:56'),(282,72,'heading','Most Trusted, Sustainable Mobility Partner in India','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:32:56'),(283,72,'paragraphs','[\"Experience Refex Mobility, a hub of innovation and sustainability in India\'s mobility landscape. As the flagship venture of Refex Green Mobility Limited, we\'re dedicated to revolutionizing urban commuting. Under the esteemed Refex Group, a recognized leader and Great Place To Work certified organization, Refex Mobility pioneers India\'s sustainable mobility revolution.\",\"We provide exceptional commuting solutions with a 100% cleaner-fuelled fleet. Our commitment extends to a comprehensive charging infrastructure and dedicated charging hub in the cities we operate.\"]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:32:56'),(284,72,'buttonText','Explore our Solutions','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:32:56'),(285,72,'buttonLink','#solutions','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-16 12:33:17'),(286,72,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-reliable-1766690183784-270326.png','text',8302,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 19:16:26'),(287,73,'title','Refex Mobility Solutions','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:33:41'),(288,73,'solutions','[{\"key\":\"employee-transportation\",\"title\":\"Employee Transportation\",\"description\":\"Offering efficient, reliable, and customizable employee transportation services tailored to your organization\'s unique needs. With professional, verified drivers and well-maintained, clean vehicles, we ensure a safe and seamless daily commute. Trusted by leading corporate enterprises, we help businesses transition to tech-enabled, sustainable mobility solutions aligned with their ESG and carbon reduction goals.\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-integrated-electric-fleet-solutions01-1766690256558-350528.jpg\",\"icon\":\"\"},{\"key\":\"corporate-airport-transfers\",\"title\":\"Corporate Airport Transfers\",\"description\":\"We provide premium and punctual pre-booked airport pick-up and drop-off services for corporate clients, ensuring a seamless travel experience from and to the airport 24/7. Our commitment to safety and timeliness makes us the preferred choice for airport transfers.\\n\\nCorporates can conveniently book airport rides through the Refex Mobility app and Website for a hassle-free experience.\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-integrated-electric-fleet-solutions-02-1766690290992-499275.jpg\"},{\"key\":\"on-demand-rides\",\"title\":\"On-call / On-demand Rides\",\"description\":\"We offer flexible and customizable rental packages for corporates and events designed to meet varying distance and time requirements. Choose from options such as 4hr/40km, 8hr/80km, or 10hr/100km, with the ability to tailor services based on your specific needs.\\n\\nLOCAL RIDES | AIRPORT RIDES\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-integrated-electric-fleet-solutions-03-1766690313411-413154.jpg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 19:18:38'),(289,73,'citiesTitle','Available In Major Cities','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:33:41'),(290,73,'cities','Chennai | Bengaluru | Mumbai | Hyderabad | Delhi NCR','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-30 17:46:32'),(291,74,'heading','Why Opt for Refex Mobility?','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-16 12:33:17'),(292,74,'description','At Refex Mobility, we\'re not just offering transportation solutions; we\'re inviting you to be a part of a movement that\'s reshaping the way we move. Elevate your journey with us and experience a future where sustainability meets innovation at every turn.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-16 12:33:17'),(293,74,'leftCards','[{\"title\":\"Sustainability Redefined\",\"description\":\"Immerse your business in a commitment to sustainability, significantly reducing your carbon footprint with our electric fleet.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-sustainability-redefined-1766690600371-932590.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Complete In-house Fleet\",\"description\":\"Trust in the reliability of our services with a 100% company-owned fleet of 1400+ cars ensuring consistency and quality in every ride.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-complete-in-house-fleet-1766690609780-694408.svg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 19:24:32'),(294,74,'rightCards','[{\"title\":\"Exclusive Fleet Ownership\",\"description\":\"Trust in the reliability of our services with a 100% company-owned electric vehicle fleet, ensuring consistency and quality in every ride.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-exclusive-fleet-ownership-1766690667588-630257.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Tech-Backed Fleet Management\",\"description\":\"Experience transparency at every level with our technology-integrated fleet management, providing real-time insights and control to our valued clients.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-tech-backed-fleet-1766690656165-961127.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Transparent Fleet Management\",\"description\":\"Experience transparency at every level with our technology-integrated fleet management, providing real-time insights and control to our valued clients.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-transparent-fleet-management-1766690644201-11324.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Dedicated Hubs & Charging Infrastructure\",\"description\":\"Our strategically located hubs and 400+ charging points across major metro cities, ensure high fleet uptime, quick turnarounds, and seamless operations without disruption.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dedicated-hubs-1766690634825-596086.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Centralized Command Center\",\"description\":\"Efficiency is at the heart of our operations with a centralized vehicle command and control center, ensuring swift responses and streamlined operations 24x7.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-centralized-command-center-1766690621584-519497.svg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 19:24:32'),(295,74,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-why-opt-for-refex-green-mobility-1766690582067-616454.png','text',8314,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 19:24:32'),(296,75,'heading','Strategic Advantages of Electric Fleets','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:34:18'),(297,75,'description','Explore the multifaceted benefits of integrating electric fleets into your corporate strategy and witness the transformative impact on your bottom line, environmental stewardship, and brand reputation. Discover the strategic advantages that position your business at the forefront of sustainable innovation.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 15:34:18'),(298,75,'advantages','[{\"title\":\"Cost-Effective EV Solutions\",\"description\":\"EVs have lower operating costs than traditional gasoline-powered vehicles, which can result in significant savings for corporations.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-cost-effective-ev-solutions-1766690515031-687837.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Eco-Revolutionary Fleet Choices\",\"description\":\"By adopting electric fleets, companies can demonstrate their commitment to environmental responsibility & social sustainability, improving their reputation & brand image.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-eco-revolutionary-fleet-choices-1766690525263-111483.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Emission-Free EV Journeys\",\"description\":\"EVs emit less greenhouse gas and other pollutants than traditional vehicles, helping companies to reduce their carbon footprint and meet sustainability goals.\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-emission-free-ev-journeys-1766690534155-371835.svg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 19:22:16'),(299,75,'image1','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-strategic-advantages-of-electric-fleets-1-1766690476262-353603.jpg','text',8310,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 19:21:21'),(300,75,'image2','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-strategic-advantages-of-electric-fleets-2-1766690461425-41161.jpg','text',8309,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 19:21:21'),(301,75,'imageBottom','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-ewheelz-cta-image-e1704363936888-1-2048x1266-1766690447384-535901.jpg','text',8308,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 19:21:21'),(302,76,'title','Corporate Mobility Redefined','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-31 10:57:59'),(303,76,'paragraphs','[\"With Refex Mobility, embrace a new standard in urban commuting. Our cleaner-fuelled vehicles, from comfortable sedans to premium SUVs, are tailored for corporate needs with efficiency and environmental responsibility.\",\"By choosing us, your business not only optimizes cost but also actively accelerates our collective journey toward a carbon-neutral India.\"]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-31 10:57:59'),(304,76,'buttonText','Visit Website','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-16 12:33:17'),(305,76,'buttonLink','https://refexmobility.com/','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-16 12:33:17'),(306,76,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-ewheelz-cta-image-e1704363936888-1-1-scaled-1766690361654-823935.jpg','text',8307,'2025-12-16 12:33:17','2025-12-25 19:19:30'),(307,77,'title','A Global API Partner from Refex','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-21 18:25:21'),(308,77,'description','A leading pharmaceutical platform with 40+ years of API excellence, global partnerships in advanced intermediates, and CRDMO expertise in speciality formulations and antibiotics.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-21 18:25:21'),(309,77,'stats','[{\"value\":\"550\",\"suffix\":\"+\",\"label\":\"Customers\"},{\"value\":\"100\",\"suffix\":\"+\",\"label\":\"Innovative Products\"},{\"value\":\"80\",\"suffix\":\"+\",\"label\":\"Countries\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-21 18:25:21'),(310,77,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-hero-section-bg-1766690026955-525934.jpg','text',8300,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-25 19:13:49'),(311,78,'logos','[{\"name\":\"Modérro\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-modepro-web-cl-mdkf4-1766726513424-101477.png\"},{\"name\":\"RLFC\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-rlfc-web-dnwvt2dr-1766726544349-486255.png\"},{\"name\":\"Extrovis\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-extrovis-ceb4cwpi-1766726531916-100025.png\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-26 05:22:26'),(312,79,'heading','About Refex Life Sciences','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-26 05:22:40'),(313,79,'paragraphs','[\"At Refex Life Sciences, innovation defines who we are. As the pharmaceutical platform of the Refex Group, we combine cutting-edge science with customer-focused excellence to advance healthcare globally.\",\"Our journey began with the acquisition of RLFC, a 40-year-old API company whose legacy we infused with the Refex spirit of innovation. We expanded further with Modepro, strengthening our advanced intermediate capabilities, and with Extrovis, establishing a global footprint in speciality formulations and antibiotics.\"]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-16 12:42:25'),(314,80,'heading','Research & Development Excellence','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-26 05:23:09'),(315,80,'description','At Refex Life Sciences, innovation is our engine of growth. With world-class R&D centres and a team of over 200 scientists, we are advancing the frontiers of both API development and complex finished dosage formulations (FDFs). Our research is focused on creating differentiated, sustainable, and patient-centric solutions that address unmet needs across global healthcare.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-26 05:23:09'),(316,80,'capabilities','[{\"title\":\"Sustainable Process Development\",\"icon\":\"ri-recycle-line\"},{\"title\":\"Chiral Chemistry Expertise\",\"icon\":\"ri-contrast-2-line\"},{\"title\":\"Complex Chemistry Capabilities\",\"icon\":\"ri-flask-line\"},{\"title\":\"Impurity & Genotoxic Control\",\"icon\":\"ri-shield-check-line\"},{\"title\":\"Technology Transfer\",\"icon\":\"ri-exchange-line\"},{\"title\":\"Green Chemistry Principles\",\"icon\":\"ri-leaf-line\"},{\"title\":\"Regulatory Support\",\"icon\":\"ri-file-shield-line\"},{\"title\":\"Over 200 scientists\",\"icon\":\"ri-team-line\"},{\"title\":\"Collaboration + Specialization\",\"icon\":\"ri-group-line\"},{\"title\":\"Cross-functional Approach\",\"icon\":\"ri-links-line\"},{\"title\":\"Passion and Professionalism\",\"icon\":\"ri-star-line\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-16 12:42:25'),(317,81,'heading','Manufacturing Excellence','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-16 12:42:25'),(318,81,'description','Our global manufacturing footprint spans APIs, intermediates, and finished formulations, supported by stringent regulatory approvals and world-class infrastructure. Together, these facilities enable us to deliver quality, scale, and reliability to partners across 80+ countries.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-16 12:42:25'),(319,81,'formulationsFacilities','[{\"title\":\"Sermoneta Facility\",\"location\":\"Sermoneta, Italy\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-sermoneta-plant-bybkcaae-1766726861374-258112.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Sugar Land Facility\",\"location\":\"Sugar Land, Texas, US\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-sugarland-plant-ddnofhkj-1766726880337-661508.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Hungary Packaging Facility\",\"location\":\"Hungary\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-hungary-plant-cfjj5xbw-1766726933803-609066.jpg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-26 05:30:24'),(320,81,'rlfcCapabilities','[{\"title\":\"Hindupur Plant\",\"location\":\"Hindupur, India\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-hindupur-plant-xdzvuwnt-1766726952296-691022.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Gauribidnaur Plant\",\"location\":\"Gauribidnaur, India\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-gauribidnaur-plant-cfwmnm7t-1766726971155-844657.jpg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-26 05:30:24'),(321,81,'expansionNote','Expansion: Hyderabad plant set for a new manufacturing block in 2025, reflecting our growing scale.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-16 12:42:25'),(322,81,'oncologyFacilities','[{\"title\":\"Kurkumbh Plant\",\"location\":\"Kurkumbh, India\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-kurkumbh-plant-cqgmpymd-1766726993585-835803.jpeg\"},{\"title\":\"Ambernath Facility\",\"location\":\"Ambernath, India\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-ambernath-plant-dhi-i8gb-1766727017166-397560.jpeg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-26 05:30:24'),(323,81,'approvalsHeading','Regulatory Approvals','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-16 12:42:25'),(324,81,'approvalsDescription','Refex Life Sciences operates a worldwide network of state-of-the-art manufacturing facilities seamlessly integrated into the group. These facilities comply with the highest international quality standards with accreditations from:','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-16 12:42:25'),(325,81,'approvals','[{\"name\":\"US FDA\",\"icon\":\"ri-government-line\",\"color\":\"#7DC244\"},{\"name\":\"EU GMP\",\"icon\":\"ri-shield-check-line\",\"color\":\"#EE6A31\"},{\"name\":\"EDQM\",\"icon\":\"ri-file-shield-line\",\"color\":\"#7DC244\"},{\"name\":\"Health Canada\",\"icon\":\"ri-hospital-line\",\"color\":\"#EE6A31\"},{\"name\":\"ANVISA\",\"icon\":\"ri-shield-star-line\",\"color\":\"#7DC244\"},{\"name\":\"PMDA\",\"icon\":\"ri-medal-line\",\"color\":\"#EE6A31\"},{\"name\":\"WHO-GMP\",\"icon\":\"ri-global-line\",\"color\":\"#7DC244\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-16 12:42:25'),(326,82,'title','Redefining Excellence in API Development','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-26 05:26:54'),(327,82,'description','Experience a new era at RLFC, redefining API development with unwavering commitment to cutting-edge solutions. Setting pioneering standards, we drive transformative advancements in global healthcare.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-26 05:26:54'),(328,82,'buttonText','Visit Website','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-26 05:26:54'),(329,82,'buttonLink','https://refexlifesciences.com/','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-16 12:42:25'),(330,82,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-cta-bg-1766726797488-48977.jpg','text',8364,'2025-12-16 12:42:25','2025-12-26 05:26:54'),(331,83,'subtitle','Venwind Refex','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:54:42','2025-12-25 15:35:03'),(332,83,'title','Harnessing and Powering the Future with Sustainable Wind Technology','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:54:42','2025-12-25 15:35:03'),(333,83,'description','Venwind Refex has an exclusive license from Vensys Energy AG, Germany, to manufacture 5.3 MW wind turbines featuring a permanent magnet generator and hybrid drivetrain technology. More than 120 GW of wind turbine generators using Vensys technology are in operation across five continents and multiple countries. Currently, we have been licensed to manufacture the state-of-the-art wind turbine technology in India.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:54:42','2025-12-25 15:35:03'),(334,83,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-venwind-banner-1766689740671-24220.jpg','text',8289,'2025-12-16 12:54:42','2025-12-25 19:09:03'),(335,84,'stats','[{\"value\":\"128\",\"suffix\":\"+ GW\",\"description\":\"Operational Worldwide based on Vensys technology\"},{\"value\":\"38\",\"suffix\":\"+\",\"description\":\"Countries Operating globally utilizing wind turbine technology by Vensys\"},{\"value\":\"5.3\",\"suffix\":\" MW\",\"description\":\"Permanent Magnet Generator with Medium-Speed Gearbox Hybrid Technology – Best in Class\"},{\"value\":\"183.4\",\"suffix\":\"m\",\"description\":\"Rotor Diameter and 130m Tower Height – Capturing Optimal Wind Energy\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:54:42','2025-12-27 14:00:43'),(336,84,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-about-usbg-630x630-1-1766689769652-104090.jpg','text',8290,'2025-12-16 12:54:42','2025-12-25 19:09:45'),(337,85,'heading','What makes us unique?','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:54:42','2025-12-25 15:35:55'),(338,85,'description','We offer wind turbines with advanced German technology from Vensys Energy AG at competitive prices.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 12:54:42','2025-12-25 15:35:55'),(339,85,'features','[{\"text\":\"Hybrid drive-train (gearbox + medium speed PMG) for superior performance\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-hybrid-drive-1766689832267-83397.svg\"},{\"text\":\"Proven technology with global installations in Australia, South Africa, Brazil and the Middle East\",\"icon\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-gene