eral-ceiling-mounted-dr-1766689101990-718876.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Image Display Monitors\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"features\":[\"Accurate visualization with high resolution, brightness and contrast ratio from any angle.\",\"Ergonomic design for enhanced comfort, speed and immersion.\",\"Optimized image quality with uniform luminance and long term consistency.\",\"Multi monitor setup and multi-modal compatibility.\"],\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-image-display-monitors-1766689089050-125690.jpg\",\"description\":\"A comprehensive set of Radiology and OT scope display monitors with USFDA/CE-certification bringing dependable diagnostic imaging to its true potential. Amplify your reading experience with:\"},{\"title\":\"X-ray film digitizer\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"features\":[\"Easy to scan all sizes of X-ray films\",\"High quality mammography scan\",\"Scan time- 8 secs for 14 x17 film\",\"Support data format- DCM, BMP, JPEG, DICOM\",\"Slim data size (max 3.3MB /200dpi)\",\"One-click scans with auto-sizing\",\"Brightness control for each X-ray film\",\"Various support for PACS viewer\"],\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-x-ray-film-digitizer-1766689073070-905380.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Myrian\",\"subtitle\":\"An advanced, fully orchestrated visualization solution\",\"features\":[\"Smart layout\",\"Quick patient throughput\",\"Multi modality\",\"Patient lifeline\",\"Dedicated tools by modality\",\"Seamless communication\"],\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-mytian-1766689057168-227612.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"FPD C-arm\",\"subtitle\":\"An advanced imaging solution for high-end surgeries in Orthopedics, Urology, Neurology, Gastrointestinal, and Pain Management.\",\"features\":[\"Cesium Iodide FPD for high-resolution, high-contrast imaging\",\"Large FOV captures more anatomy in one shot\",\"Low radiation dose with advanced dose management\",\"ADONIS TIALIC ensures optimized low-dose clarity\",\"Wireless, PACS-ready digital storage\",\"Compact design for flexible use in tight spaces\"],\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-x-ray-film-digitizer-copy-1-1766689047890-554083.jpg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:10:06','2025-12-31 05:29:16'),(361,92,'title','Certifications','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:10:06','2025-12-31 12:25:19'),(362,92,'certifications','[{\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-images-1766688003436-169444.jpg\",\"title\":\"AERB\"},{\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-1536257006-9131-jpg-removebg-preview-1766688030017-452197.png\",\"title\":\"CDSCO\"},{\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-bis-certification-services-1766688039253-726215.jpg\",\"title\":\"BIS\"},{\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-b136d1c0df779785-400x400ar-1766688049402-149779.jpg\",\"title\":\"ISO 13485\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:10:06','2025-12-25 18:40:52'),(363,93,'title','Clientele','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:10:06','2025-12-16 13:10:06'),(364,93,'clientLogos','[8243,8244,8246,8245,8247,8248,8250,8249,8251,8252,8256,8253,8255,8254,8257,8258,8263,8262,8264,8261,8265,8260,8266,8259]','json',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:10:06','2025-12-25 18:45:43'),(365,94,'title','Pioneers and Conscious Innovators in the Refrigerant gas Industry.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-31 12:37:26'),(366,94,'subtitle','A market leader in refrigerant gas manufacturing, we are also conscious innovators. Discover our eco-friendly alternatives to make the step towards a greener tomorrow.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-16 13:13:58'),(367,94,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-quality-refilling-1766675758499-764252.jpeg','text',8166,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-25 15:16:01'),(368,95,'heading','Overview','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-16 13:13:58'),(369,95,'description','For over two decades, Refex Refrigerants has been a trusted name in the refrigerant gas industry. We specialise in refilling and supplying high‑quality refrigerant gases while constantly innovating to introduce eco‑friendly alternatives that meet evolving environmental norms and customer expectations.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-16 13:13:58'),(370,96,'heading','Our Products','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-31 10:06:28'),(371,96,'description','Discover our innovative and eco-friendly products that are produced to meet your needs while making a positive impact on the environment.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-31 10:06:28'),(372,97,'heading','Quality Assurance & Safety ','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-31 10:04:23'),(373,97,'description','Our commitment to excellence and attention to detail has established our products as a benchmark in the industry. You can trust Refex to provide you with the highest quality and safest products for all your refrigerant gas needs.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-31 10:04:23'),(374,98,'heading','Applications','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-16 13:13:58'),(375,98,'description','Refex Refrigerants serves a diverse set of applications including residential air‑conditioning, commercial cold storage, industrial refrigeration and specialised process cooling. Our technical team supports customers in choosing the right refrigerant for performance, efficiency and regulatory needs.','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-16 13:13:58'),(376,99,'card1Title','Talk to our refrigerant experts','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-16 13:13:58'),(377,99,'card1ButtonText','Contact Us','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-16 13:13:58'),(378,99,'card1ButtonLink','/contact','text',NULL,'2025-12-16 13:13:58','2025-12-16 13:13:58'),(379,1,'backgroundImageId','48','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 17:24:18','2025-12-18 17:24:18'),(380,1,'description','Refex Group, founded in 2002, diversified into ash and coal handling, power trading, refrigerant gas, medTech etc.','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 17:27:06','2025-12-19 16:08:07'),(381,2,'yearsInBusiness','23','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 17:28:09','2025-12-30 10:35:59'),(382,2,'peopleImpacted','2','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 17:28:09','2025-12-30 10:36:09'),(383,2,'imageId','49','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 17:28:09','2025-12-18 17:28:09'),(384,2,'logoId','2233','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 17:28:09','2025-12-18 18:01:19'),(385,100,'backgroundColor','#49a28f','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 17:36:56','2025-12-19 16:11:53'),(386,3,'backgroundImageId','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 18:02:18','2025-12-18 18:02:18'),(387,4,'timelineImagePositionX','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 18:04:36','2025-12-18 18:04:36'),(388,4,'timelineImagePositionY','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 18:04:37','2025-12-18 18:04:37'),(389,8,'backgroundPatternPositionX','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 18:41:40','2025-12-18 18:41:40'),(390,8,'backgroundPatternPositionY','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-18 18:41:40','2025-12-18 18:41:40'),(391,94,'backgroundImageId','12','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:03:45','2025-12-19 05:03:45'),(392,40,'backgroundImageId','76','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:05:22','2025-12-19 05:05:22'),(393,101,'heading','Why Choose Us','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:37:36','2025-12-25 15:16:52'),(394,101,'cards','[{\"title\":\"State-of-the-art Automated Filling Equipment\",\"description\":\"Experience unparalleled convenience and precision at our refilling factory, featuring automated and dedicated filling lines suitable for all products and sizes of cylinders, tonners, and cans.\",\"iconPath\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-state-of-art-1766683693646-588292.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Well Networked Logistics\",\"description\":\"Our expert logistics network guarantees prompt and reliable shipping, backed by our extensive experience in streamlining orders and ensuring timely supply.\",\"iconPath\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-wellnetwork-1766682599876-261807.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Highest Quality Standards\",\"description\":\"Our comprehensive product testing capabilities uphold the highest quality standards in each and every process to ensure maximum efficiency, precision, and quality control.\",\"iconPath\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-highquality-1766682548737-907935.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Reliable Shipping\",\"description\":\"Exclusive partnerships with trusted forwarders to guarantee secure and expedited shipping.\",\"iconPath\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-reliableshipping-1766682555946-989439.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Skilled Employees\",\"description\":\"Dedicated employees with excellent engineering expertise providing exceptional service and high-quality products to our valued business partners and consumers.\",\"iconPath\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-skilledemployees-1766682570212-339755.svg\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:37:36','2025-12-31 12:12:47'),(395,103,'title','Breaking new grounds with innovative and sustainable solutions in Refrigerant gas refilling.','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:37:36','2025-12-25 15:17:02'),(396,103,'backgroundColor','#1e5a8e','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:37:36','2025-12-19 05:37:36'),(397,102,'title','Refex Industries Limited','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:37:36','2025-12-19 05:37:36'),(398,102,'description','A market leader in the refrigerant gas industry. Discover our eco-friendly alternatives and pave your way towards a greener tomorrow.','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:37:36','2025-12-19 05:37:36'),(399,102,'buttonText','Visit Website','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:37:36','2025-12-19 05:37:36'),(400,102,'buttonLink','https://www.refex.co.in/','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:37:36','2025-12-31 16:38:40'),(401,102,'gradientOverlay','linear-gradient(185deg, #2A78B247 0%, #1e5a8e 71%)','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:37:36','2025-12-19 05:37:36'),(402,96,'products','[{\"name\":\"R-32\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-r32-1024x1024-1766684037420-867285.jpg\"},{\"name\":\"R-134a\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-r134a-background-removed-medium-1766684106756-931579.png\"},{\"name\":\"R-404a\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-r404a-background-removed-medium-1766684126365-308714.png\"},{\"name\":\"R-407c\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-r407c-background-removed-medium-1766684146218-22037.png\"},{\"name\":\"R-410a\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-r410a-background-removed-medium-1766684163637-61625.png\"},{\"name\":\"R-22\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-r22-can-background-removed-medium-1-1766684183676-749605.png\"},{\"name\":\"R-22\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-r22-cylinder-background-removed-1024x1024-1766684215005-983963.png\"},{\"name\":\"R-152a\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-r152a-cylinder-medium-1766684240918-274131.png\"},{\"name\":\"R-600a\",\"image\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-600a-background-removed-medium-1766684261606-748818.png\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:39:08','2025-12-25 17:37:44'),(403,94,'tagline','Refex Refrigerants','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2026-01-01 09:43:10'),(404,94,'description','Since the inception in 2002, Refex has established itself as a formidable leader and competitor in the refrigerant gas industry. In the last twenty years of our quest towards climate-friendly alternatives, we have successfully developed and expanded our product lines to include innovative and environmental-friendly options. We are also proactively addressing and tackling sourcing and environmental policy changes. Our focus is on sustainability and we are dedicated to creating a better future!','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-25 15:15:47'),(405,94,'buttonText','Explore','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-25 15:15:47'),(406,94,'buttonLink','#explore','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-19 05:49:03'),(407,94,'backgroundColor','#1e5a8e','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-19 05:49:03'),(408,96,'backgroundColor','#f5f5f5','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-19 05:49:03'),(409,96,'cardBackgroundColor','#1e5a8e','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-19 05:49:03'),(410,97,'backgroundGradient','linear-gradient(360deg, rgba(42, 120, 178, 0.14) 68%, rgba(30, 90, 142, 0.05) 100%)','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-19 05:49:03'),(411,97,'tab1Label','Product Quality','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-25 15:18:09'),(412,97,'tab2Label','Product Safety','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-25 15:18:09'),(413,97,'tabButtonColor','#1e5a8e','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-19 05:49:03'),(414,97,'tab1Items','[\"We provide each customer with a Certificate of Analysis that conforms to the highest quality standards, we test and analyze all products before and after filling in our state-of-the-art laboratory to ensure consistency.\",\"Keeping in pace with the market revolution, we have fully committed ourselves to continuous improvement, innovation, and implementation in all our processes , right from filling to customer service. Our focus on quality, timely delivery, and customer satisfaction is reflected in our success.\",\"Our dedication to quality is ingrained in every aspect of our business. We pride ourselves on building long-lasting relationships with our customers by providing quality products and services that exceed expectations.\"]','json',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-25 15:18:09'),(415,97,'tab2Items','[\"At Refex, we take the security and safety of our products very seriously. Each product is provided with a dedicated storage facility, approved and licensed by PESO, PCB, and other relevant authorities. We ensure 100% compliance with all regulations and use the best fabricators in the industry.\",\"Quality and safety are our top priorities at Refex. We are certified with ISO 14001:2015, and our in-house laboratory tests and analyzes every product for purity of gas and moisture content before and after filling. We take great care to ensure the quality of all cylinders before filling with gases.\"]','json',NULL,'2025-12-19 05:49:03','2025-12-25 15:18:09'),(416,45,'backgroundImageId','14','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 06:03:10','2025-12-19 06:03:10'),(417,46,'imageId','81','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 06:04:06','2025-12-19 06:04:06'),(418,48,'backgroundImageId','6','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 06:05:24','2025-12-19 06:05:24'),(419,6,'backgroundImageId','2239','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 12:09:01','2025-12-19 12:16:25'),(420,13,'imageId','61','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 12:17:50','2025-12-19 12:17:50'),(421,22,'overlayOpacity','10','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 17:01:18','2025-12-19 17:45:06'),(422,22,'backgroundImageId','2279','text',NULL,'2025-12-19 17:20:05','2025-12-19 18:03:33'),(423,23,'contactEmail','info@refex.co.in','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 05:28:35','2025-12-20 05:28:35'),(424,104,'title','Newsroom','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 05:32:15','2025-12-20 05:32:15'),(425,104,'description','Get hyped for the latest buzz on our businesses and community initiatives, as well as inspiring stories about the amazing people behind them!','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 05:32:15','2025-12-20 05:32:15'),(426,104,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-gallery-3i-medtech-iria-2022-5-1766671582932-471018.jpg','text',8148,'2025-12-20 05:32:15','2025-12-25 14:06:26'),(427,105,'card1Title','Got a question?','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 05:32:15','2025-12-20 05:32:15'),(428,105,'card1ButtonText','Get in touch','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 05:32:15','2025-12-20 05:32:15'),(429,105,'card1ButtonLink','/contact','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 05:32:15','2025-12-20 05:32:15'),(430,105,'card2Title','Work at Refex','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 05:32:15','2025-12-20 05:32:15'),(431,105,'card2ButtonText','Careers','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 05:32:15','2025-12-20 05:32:15'),(432,105,'card2ButtonLink','/careers','text',NULL,'