-12-20 07:13:47','2025-12-20 07:13:47'),(450,106,'overlayColor','#000000','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 07:13:47','2025-12-20 07:13:47'),(451,106,'backgroundImage','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-gallery-refex-awards-7-1766675417900-343165.jpg','text',8163,'2025-12-20 07:13:47','2025-12-25 15:10:21'),(452,107,'title','Welcome to Refex Group\'s gallery!','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 07:13:47','2025-12-20 07:13:47'),(453,107,'description','We take pride in showcasing our achievements, milestones, and notable events. Our state-of-the-art facilities, involvement in social and community initiatives, and collaborations with businesses and governments highlight our commitment to sustainability and innovation. Explore our gallery to learn more about our journey towards building a better future for ourselves and the planet.','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 07:13:47','2025-12-20 07:13:47'),(454,107,'image','/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-2025-thumbnail-1024x6843rd-1766748031332-560286.jpg','text',8450,'2025-12-20 07:13:47','2025-12-26 11:20:34'),(455,108,'bgGradientFrom','#3b9dd6','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 07:31:12','2025-12-20 07:31:12'),(456,108,'bgGradientTo','#4db3e8','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 07:31:12','2025-12-20 07:31:12'),(457,108,'cards','[{\"title\":\"Got a question?\",\"buttonText\":\"Get in touch\",\"buttonLink\":\"/contact\"},{\"title\":\"See our latest news\",\"buttonText\":\"Refex Newsroom\",\"buttonLink\":\"/newsroom\"},{\"title\":\"Work at Refex\",\"buttonText\":\"Careers\",\"buttonLink\":\"/careers\"}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-20 07:31:12','2025-12-20 07:31:12'),(458,106,'backgroundImagePositionX','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 07:44:15','2025-12-20 07:44:15'),(459,106,'backgroundImagePositionY','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 07:44:15','2025-12-25 15:10:21'),(460,107,'imagePositionX','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 07:45:44','2025-12-20 07:45:44'),(461,107,'imagePositionY','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 07:45:44','2025-12-20 07:45:44'),(462,26,'imagePositionX','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 09:08:38','2025-12-20 09:08:38'),(463,26,'imagePositionY','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 09:08:38','2025-12-20 09:08:38'),(464,25,'backgroundImagePositionX','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 09:53:32','2025-12-20 09:53:32'),(465,25,'backgroundImagePositionY','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 09:53:32','2025-12-20 09:53:32'),(466,28,'initiatives','[{\"name\":\"Vamika\",\"logo\":8161,\"description\":\"Refex has created an internal networking forum called \'Vamika\' that prioritizes the career, physical, and mental wellness support of women. The initiative emphasizes the well-being of women and aims to promote their health.\",\"images\":[\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-vamika-wellness-refex-1-1766741351996-367651.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-vamika-wellness-refex-2-1766741376056-253535.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-vamika-wellness-refex-3-1766741404915-725855.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-vamika-wellness-refex-4-1766741412149-46376.jpg\"],\"coverImage\":\"\",\"orderIndex\":0},{\"name\":\"Vamika Oncologist\",\"logo\":8420,\"description\":\"A special oncology session was organized for women employees, focusing on early detection, prevention, and holistic wellbeing; reinforcing our commitment to a supportive and health-conscious workplace at Refex.\",\"images\":[\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-9609-min-1766740768056-337504.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-9632-min-1766740768181-111939.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-9663-min-1766740768307-932198.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-9674-min-1766740768454-4464.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-9689-min-1766740768582-740799.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-9693-min-1766740768668-316946.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-9704-min-1766740768744-573692.jpg\"],\"coverImage\":\"\",\"orderIndex\":1},{\"name\":\"Krav Maga\",\"logo\":8429,\"description\":\"Refex has taken a proactive step towards addressing women\'s safety by organizing a self-defense workshop called \'Krav Maga.\' The workshop, which was available to all women, aimed to equip them with the necessary skills to protect themselves.\",\"images\":[\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-8790-1766740854291-222871.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-8813-1766740854444-554440.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-8826-1766740854569-580839.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-8878-1766740855453-347928.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-8880-1766740855669-262060.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-8882-1766740855869-667153.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-8883-1766740855951-435725.jpg\",\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-8897-1766740856049-995293.jpg\"],\"coverImage\":\"/uploads/images/general/general/general-general-dsc-8813-1766740854444-554440.jpg\",\"orderIndex\":2}]','json',NULL,'2025-12-20 10:24:21','2025-12-26 09:30:19'),(467,1,'backgroundImagePositionX','42','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 14:40:09','2025-12-20 14:41:06'),(468,1,'backgroundImagePositionY','34','text',NULL,'2025-12-20 14:40:09','2025-12-20 14:40:09'),(469,6,'backgroundImagePositionX','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-21 03:55:47','2025-12-21 03:55:47'),(470,6,'backgroundImagePositionY','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-21 03:55:47','2025-12-21 03:55:47'),(471,6,'description','At Refex, we\'re constantly changing from the inside to change the world outside. Learn how our business strives to make a difference.','text',NULL,'2025-12-21 03:55:47','2025-12-21 03:57:23'),(472,7,'logoPositionX','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-21 04:01:34','2025-12-21 04:01:34'),(473,7,'logoPositionY','50','text',NULL,'2025-12-21 04:01:34','2025-12-21 